#: ../../quickstart.md:1 e068e63e059949248e247cf172ad8ebd
msgid "🚀 Quickstart"
msgstr "🚀 快速开始"

#: ../../quickstart.md:3 a395df8acc374a8a892620e2fa8bf0ba
msgid ""
"This page shows how to start using Bookshelf. Like it? Star on "
"[GitHub](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf) or follow on "
"[Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/organization/mcbookshelf)."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何开始使用 Bookshelf。喜欢这个项目？欢迎在 "
"[GitHub](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf) 上点亮 Star，或在 "
"[Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/organization/mcbookshelf) 上关注我们。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:7 45c0abe5190f46f3ac05b576ff4d2f82
msgid "📥 Installation"
msgstr "📥 安装"

#: ../../quickstart.md 0b41ac9e84c2462e90c43941a84344b4
msgid "🔌 from manager"
msgstr "🔌 通过管理器安装"

#: ../../quickstart.md:13 28c75266b7e14d96a2a847c1582d9325
msgid "Use the manager to make a custom bundle."
msgstr "使用管理器制作自定义捆绑包。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:15 70a00fbb88634fd19f40463131b3fa9a
msgid "Go to [mcbookshelf.dev](https://mcbookshelf.dev)"
msgstr "前往 [mcbookshelf.dev](https://mcbookshelf.dev)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:16 8ea9aaf9f30c4e8fa893e8180c76d2fe
msgid "Pick your modules"
msgstr "选择你的模块"

#: ../../quickstart.md:17 b54791c13e1b4696af8402a6eedeb982
msgid "Review dependencies"
msgstr "检查依赖关系"

#: ../../quickstart.md:18 a1a833cb28df4e0bbc5474652fbe97fe
msgid "Download the bundle"
msgstr "下载捆绑包"

#: ../../quickstart.md:20 ../../quickstart.md:31
#: 780c6a91913d488c9999444d27768d19 99e8c6ac4af04150a71e222ae5a63145
msgid "After downloading, move the ZIP file to your world's `datapacks` folder."
msgstr "下载后，将 ZIP 文件移至 Minecraft 世界的 `datapacks` 文件夹。"

#: ../../quickstart.md 794b9f0b09cc40a08ba326786dea54da
msgid "🏷️ from release"
msgstr "🏷️ 通过发布版本安装"

#: ../../quickstart.md:25 86219226113242a2a1ad75dc5b58d73a
msgid ""
"Get releases from "
"[GitHub](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/releases) or "
"[Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/organization/mcbookshelf). You can "
"download either:"
msgstr ""
"可从 [GitHub](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/releases) 或 "
"[Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/organization/mcbookshelf) 获取发布版本，并选择下载："

#: ../../quickstart.md:28 741fbcfb22004243aefcba44eaa044fb
msgid "📚 **Bundles:** groups of related modules with their dependencies"
msgstr "📚 **捆绑包：** 相关模块及其依赖项的组"

#: ../../quickstart.md:29 a1101ce035534c24b69efb38e982348f
msgid "🧩 **Modules:** a single module with its dependencies"
msgstr "🧩 **模块：** 单个模块及其依赖项"

#: ../../quickstart.md 376cd543706242a79c0f791d8e97628b
msgid "🐍 from PyPI, with Beet"
msgstr "🐍 通过 PyPI 安装，配合 Beet 使用"

#: ../../quickstart.md:36 cd9f4e8b76a446218866f2b1c51d26d2
msgid ""
"If you use the [beet](https://github.com/mcbeet/beet) pipeline, install "
"`mcbookshelf` from PyPI:"
msgstr ""
"如果你使用 [beet](https://github.com/mcbeet/beet) 构建流程，请从 PyPI 安装 "
"`mcbookshelf`："

#: ../../quickstart.md:41 cb0fbdf73eef4eaf91b8a195cf3f1f2d
msgid "Then, reference Bookshelf bundles or modules in your beet config:"
msgstr "然后，在 beet 配置中引用 Bookshelf 捆绑包或模块："

#: ../../quickstart.md:43 dfe8b4e6181941378a04406ec63fd618
msgid "beet.yml"
msgstr "beet.yml"

#: ../../quickstart.md 1918dc7a7e2f4fe395b8049e12ae7a61
msgid "🗃️ from source"
msgstr "🗃️ 从源代码构建"

#: ../../quickstart.md:55 0671401b97104b4a94a680656a567e49
msgid "To work with the source code, you must first build Bookshelf."
msgstr "要处理源代码，你必须先构建 Bookshelf。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:57 ddc35d2950ae4d79b6a153bc9194bb03
msgid "🛠️ Requirements"
msgstr "🛠️ 准备工作"

#: ../../quickstart.md:59 996220cf8b454987a9b50abba31cd09c
msgid "Datapack basics"
msgstr "数据包基础"

#: ../../quickstart.md:60 18c2aa2192f049c495784ab61beaa46c
msgid "[Git](https://git-scm.com/install/) installed"
msgstr "已安装 [Git](https://git-scm.com/install/)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:61 42dd7a94dbea489cbbcd17413dc6362f
msgid "[uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/) installed"
msgstr "已安装 [UV](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:63 dfc469bcd5af4524b6bbf651e1b2c037
msgid "📥 Installation steps"
msgstr "📥 安装步骤"

#: ../../quickstart.md:65 58c80a84582840b5aca031ba43fda497
msgid "Clone the repository:"
msgstr "克隆仓库："

#: ../../quickstart.md:71 91a4114e2fb8495abcba43d3948db13a
msgid "Build the modules:"
msgstr "构建模块："

#: ../../quickstart.md:76 9ae70c69eeb247f7b4c68761a9eaa67f
msgid "Built modules appear in the `build` folder."
msgstr "构建的模块出现在 `build` 文件夹中。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:81 1b1904e76f2b4b6cbebd3acb017d6b98
msgid ""
"Release datapacks are stable but may not be the newest. For the latest "
"features or fixes, build from source or use a pre-release."
msgstr "发布的数据包稳定但可能不是最新的。要获取最新功能或修复，请从源代码构建或使用预发布版本。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:86 cf1c814ba3ea4c499fb64a7a081960f2
msgid "👶 First steps"
msgstr "👶 开始使用"

#: ../../quickstart.md:88 13f95cdbcd2240ea9dde892297ec5f20
msgid "Run this command to check the installation:"
msgstr "运行此命令以检查安装："

#: ../../quickstart.md:94 b65f8b5d82f742418a90a3ac42dde0ee
msgid ""
"This lists loaded modules and checks for compatibility issues. If you "
"need help installing a datapack, see [this "
"guide](https://datapack.wiki/guide/installing-a-datapack)."
msgstr "该命令会列出已加载的模块并检查兼容性问题。如果你还不熟悉数据包安装，可以参考[这篇指南](https://datapack.wiki/guide/installing-a-datapack)。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:96 351b5d8e2cf646fd84c31f64fb6f414b
msgid ""
"From there, you can explore the documentation for individual modules, try"
" out examples, and start integrating their functionality into your own "
"projects!"
msgstr "确认安装正常后，你可以浏览各个模块的文档、尝试示例，并将所需功能逐步接入自己的项目。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:99 049eeea112814d8ab615408b4593aad6
msgid ""
"Bookshelf uses persistent entities. Avoid `kill @e`, use `kill "
"@e[tag=!bs.persistent]` instead. [Learn more](#contribute-shared-"
"resources)"
msgstr ""
"Bookshelf 使用持久化实体。请勿执行 `kill @e`，应改用 `kill @e[tag=!bs.persistent]`。[了解更多"
"](#contribute-shared-resources)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:100 6fc9def507154763b2bded45233b0bb6
msgid ""
"Side effects are rare, but conflicts can occur if multiple datapacks use "
"the same functions. Always set inputs before running a function."
msgstr "Bookshelf 通常不会影响其他数据包，但多个数据包调用同一函数时仍可能发生冲突。请务必先设置输入，再运行函数。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:103 0c89acf5e2274da28854bb2fd423ceaf
msgid ""
"Next, check out the [modules](modules/index.md) documentation to see each"
" module in detail and learn how to use them."
msgstr "接下来，可以查看[模块](modules/index.md)文档，了解各个模块的用途和使用方法。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:106 9be1221d8fda490486e988fd0a3c8e88
msgid ""
"This section is in progress. If you have ideas to improve it, share them "
"on the [Discord](https://discord.gg/MkXytNjmBt) server."
msgstr "本节仍在完善中。如果你有改进建议，欢迎在 [Discord](https://discord.gg/MkXytNjmBt) 服务器中提出。"

#: ../../_templates/comments.md:4 cdcd2d27c2df4378b164371a6da5a55f
msgid "**💬 Did it help you?**"
msgstr "**💬 这对你有帮助吗？**"

#: ../../_templates/comments.md:6 9657b16a9aac4a0ebbdce9cab1af56b1
msgid "Feel free to leave your questions and feedback below!"
msgstr "欢迎在下方留下你的问题和反馈！"

